{
  "name": "leech",
  "_about": "The medicinal leech (Hirudo medicinalis), 10 cm long stretched: long, flattened and muscular, tapering to the front; dark olive-green above with six orange stripes down it flecked with black, a yellow-green belly spotted black at the edges; a small sucker round the mouth and a big round one at the tail. It swims by vertical waves and loops along on land. Written whole by tools/creaturegen/rework/insects/soft.py on insectlib.py (one smooth body on a chain of bones that ripples as it crawls).",
